                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          <p>
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        A Dutch CV is typically one to two pages, concise, and focused on relevant experience. Unlike German CVs, a photo is not expected and personal details like date of birth or marital status are generally omitted. The format should be clean, professional, and easy to scan. Lead with a brief personal summary, followed by work experience in reverse-chronological order, education, skills, and languages. Cover letters are still expected for most applications and should be tailored to the specific role — generic letters are quickly filtered out.
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    </p>
